WEBVTT

00:04:59.686 --> 00:05:04.000
who live in countries with about two children per woman.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.538
(Applause)

00:05:07.538 --> 00:05:11.498
It's a quite amazing development which has happened.

00:05:11.498 --> 00:05:12.875
(Applause)

00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:16.077
And these are countries from United States here,

00:05:16.077 --> 00:05:18.238
with $40,000 per capita,

00:05:18.238 --> 00:05:21.185
France, Russia, Iran,

00:05:21.185 --> 00:05:24.837
Mexico, Turkey, Algeria,

00:05:24.837 --> 00:05:27.062
Indonesia, India

00:05:27.062 --> 00:05:29.791
and all the way to Bangladesh and Vietnam,

00:05:29.791 --> 00:05:33.834
which has less than five percent of the income per person of the United States